   "take": "171336",
   "at": 172.3,
   "until": 174.95
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 14.46,
   "until": 17.85,
   "text": "If you wake up in the morning and you have three things,"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 17.88,
   "until": 20.72,
   "text": "it is as if the whole world is yours."
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171951",
   "at": 10.66,
   "until": 14.2,
   "text": "There is a hadith in Jami' al-Tirmidhi. The Prophet (peace be upon him) said:"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 24.9,
   "until": 29.44,
   "text": "“Whoever among you wakes up secure in his home, healthy in his body,"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 29.6,
   "until": 33.2,
   "text": "and has his food for the day, it is as if the whole world has been gathered for him.”"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 33.35,
   "until": 36.3,
   "text": "If a person wakes up in the morning"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 41.5,
   "until": 45.7,
   "text": "in a state of peace, his body sound and healthy,"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 46.66,
   "until": 52.95,
   "text": "and he has his food and drink for the day,"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 53.0,
   "until": 56.15,
   "text": "then it is as if he owns the whole world."
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 56.72,
   "until": 62.88,
   "text": "Today, in the world's race of competition,"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 62.92,
   "until": 67.6,
   "text": "in the rush to get ever further ahead, we often forget"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 67.62,
   "until": 72.38,
   "text": "to enjoy the moment that is actually ours."
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 72.4,
   "until": 78.3,
   "text": "We get lost in plans for the future,"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 78.56,
   "until": 84.78,
   "text": "or in the griefs of the past, the mistakes we made,"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 89.6,
   "until": 90.93,
   "text": "and we stay trapped inside them."
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 98.8,
   "until": 102.4,
   "text": "What a great blessing it is to learn"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 102.42,
   "until": 106.58,
   "text": "to live the present moment with gratitude."
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 106.82,
   "until": 111.4,
   "text": "That is why Allah says that His friends, those close to Him,"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 111.42,
   "until": 114.6,
   "text": "are given a great blessing in this world:"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 116.05,
   "until": 123.38,
   "text": "no fear of the future, and no grief over the past."
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171951",
   "at": 246.3,
   "until": 249.68,
   "text": "So let me, and all of us, reflect:"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171951",
   "at": 250.1,
   "until": 256.15,
   "text": "how grateful are we for the blessings we have right now?"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 168.64,
   "until": 171.92,
   "text": "If a person makes this a habit,"
  },
  {
   "type": "sub",
   "take": "171336",
   "at": 171.94,
   "until": 174.93,
   "text": "he finds peace in life."
  }
 ],
